+
+    // --- Helpers -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+    /**
+     * Shows [MyEditsContent] for [state] in Kanso's light theme, with the solid-colour stand-in
+     * for each picture, [contentPadding] and [onPhotoClick], and waits until it is drawn.
